entries[408283] = { ["name"] = "Shadowed Razing Annihilator", ["text"] = "5 sec cast 3\nTools: Blacksmith Hammer\nReagents:\nObsidian Cobraskin (2), Primal Molten Alloy (7), Obsidian Seared Alloy (7), Shadowed Alloy (5), Spark (#247) (2)\nOptional Reagents:\nInfuse with Power (#111) , Quenching Fluid (#124) , Illustrious Insight (#93)\nDrop:\nBosses\nZone:\nAberrus, the Shadowed Crucible\nRecipe:\nPurchasable on the Auction House\n\nShadowed Razing Annihilator\nBinds when picked up\nTwo-Hand Mace\n609 - 783 Damage Speed 3.60\n(193.3 damage per second)\n+257 Strength\n+416 Stamina\n+ 335 Critical Strike\n+ 143 Versatility\nDurability 120 / 120\nUse: Strike your target with an Erupting Slam dealing 14275 Shadowflame damage.\n\nAfter a short delay, Residual Shadowflame rains on a random enemy within 15 yards dealing 18557 Shadowflame damage in a 4 yard radius. (3 Min Cooldown)\n70" }
