entries[408318] = { ["name"] = "Undulating Sporecloak", ["text"] = "5 sec cast 3\nReagents:\nZaralek Glowspores (300), Spool of Wilderthread (8), Vibrant Wildercloth Bolt (12), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nDrop:\nBosses\nZone:\nAberrus, the Shadowed Crucible\nRecipe:\nPurchasable on the Auction House\n\nUndulating Sporecloak\nBinds when picked up\nBack\n150 Armor\n+144 [Agility or Strength or Intellect]+234 Stamina\n+ 142 Versatility\n+ 127 Mastery\nEquip: When above 70% Health, gain 39 Versatility and heal for 469 every 5 sec.\n\nWhen your Health is below 30% the Symbiotic Spores embedded in your cloak expand, granting a shield that absorbs 11268 damage for 10 sec. This effect can only occur once every 2 min.\n70" }
